@startuml swc_task_cycle
title Task cycle - one OsTask_10ms activation and the 100 ms activation (TASK-027)

participant "OS\n(1 ms counter)" as OS
participant "OsTask_1ms\nprio 3" as T1
participant "OsTask_10ms\nprio 2" as T10
participant "Com" as Com
participant "CanSM" as CanSM
participant "SwcSensorInput" as SI
participant "SwcGearSelector" as GS
participant "SwcShiftCtrl" as SC
participant "SwcFaultMgr" as FM
participant "SwcSolenoidCtrl" as SOL
participant "BswM" as BswM
participant "IoHwAb" as IoHwAb
participant "CanTp / Dcm" as Diag
participant "Wdg / WdgM" as Wdg
participant "OsTask_100ms\nprio 1" as T100
participant "DbgOut CDD" as DbgOut

note over OS, DbgOut
Covers: swc_composition.md section 4 (SYS-TIM-001, SYS-FLT-003, SYS-ACT-004, SYS-COM-004, SYS-STA-002, SYS-HMI-002).
All tasks are basic tasks (BCC1), full-preemptive, AUTOSAR OS SC1. All are released at the same tick; the priority gives the order.
The RTE calls the runnables in the configured order (RtePositionInTask); explicit Rte_Read / Rte_Write.
end note

== t = 0 ms: release of OsTask_1ms, OsTask_10ms (and, at t = 0 of every 100 ms period, OsTask_100ms) ==
OS -> T1 : ActivateTask
activate T1
T1 -> T1 : Can_MainFunction_BusOff, _Read, _Write, _Mode\n(Rx indication -> CanIf -> PduR -> Com_RxIndication:\nI-PDU copied, signal update deferred)
deactivate T1
OS -> T10 : ActivateTask
activate T10
T10 -> Com : 1 Com_MainFunctionRx
note right of Com
deferred signal update; deadline monitoring
(30 ms, detected 30 .. 40 ms after the last frame);
timeout -> substitute values; notifications ->
RTE status per signal (never received / timeout)
end note
T10 -> CanSM : 2 CanSM_MainFunction
note right of CanSM
bus-off recovery; state change ->
BswM_CanSM_CurrentState -> Rte_Switch CanBusState
(immediate), visible to SwcFaultMgr in this cycle
end note
T10 -> SI : 3 SwcSensorInput_Run10ms
note right of SI
reads RpShaftSpeedIn, RpAnalogIn (value + status)
writes VehicleSpeed, Standstill, ShaftSpeeds, OilTemp,
LinePress, SensorFaults, OilTemp (TCU_Status)
end note
T10 -> GS : 4 SwcGearSelector_Run10ms
note right of GS
reads RpDriverIn (value + status), VehicleSpeed, Standstill
writes SelectorPosition, SelectorState, RLS / SLS,
SelectorFaults, ProgPrecondMask
end note
T10 -> SC : 5 SwcShiftCtrl_Run10ms
note right of SC
reads RpThrottleIn, SelectorPosition, VehicleSpeed, Standstill,
ShaftSpeeds, OilTemp, TcuMode (from the previous cycle)
writes GearTarget, GearActual, ShiftInProgress, Throttle, ShiftFaults
end note
T10 -> FM : 6 SwcFaultMgr_Run10ms
note right of FM
reads SensorFaults, SelectorFaults, ShiftFaults, PressureFault
(from the previous cycle), CanBusState, VehicleSpeed
latch (SYS-FLT-004 / -008), FaultBits, mode decision (D9, SYS-FLT-002):
Rte_Switch TcuMode on change; writes Mode, FaultBits, FaultLamp,
IRVs for Run100ms; Dem events (TASK-025)
end note
FM -> IoHwAb : FaultLamp (RTE fan-out) -> FaultLampLed -> Dio
note right of IoHwAb: red LED switched in this cycle,\nindependent of CAN (SYS-FLT-003 bus-off case)
T10 -> SOL : 7 SwcSolenoidCtrl_Run10ms
note right of SOL
reads GearTarget, ShiftInProgress, Throttle, SelectorPosition, RLS,
LinePress, FaultBits, TcuMode (this cycle)
writes SS_A, SS_B, PCS_Duty (limp-home: OFF, OFF, 0 %), PressureFault
end note
T10 -> BswM : 8 BswM_MainFunction
note right of BswM
TCU_Tx started iff TcuMode != INIT
and the Dcm communication mode enables Tx;
the first TCU_Actuators leaves in the cycle that ends Init (SYS-ACT-004)
end note
T10 -> Com : 9 Com_MainFunctionTx
note right of Com
TCU_Actuators in every call (10 ms +/- 1 ms, SYS-COM-004),
TCU_Status in every 10th call (100 ms); AliveCtr in the Tx callout;
fault reaction on the bus <= about 2.4 ms after the fault (section 4.1)
end note
T10 -> Diag : 10 CanTp_MainFunction, 11 Dcm_MainFunction
note right of Diag
Dcm reads ProgPrecondMask (10 02, RID 0x0203);
28 -> BswM (immediate); after the main functions the
variable diagnostic load does not move the Tx instant
(12 Dem_MainFunction from TASK-025)
end note
T10 -> Wdg : 13 watchdog service (last)
note right of Wdg: served only when the whole 10 ms task ran (D10);\nno service -> reset within the watchdog timeout (SYS-STA-002)
deactivate T10

group t = 0 of every 100 ms period, after OsTask_10ms has terminated
  OS -> T100 : ActivateTask (released at t = 0, runs when no higher-priority task is ready)
  activate T100
  T100 -> FM : SwcFaultMgr_Run100ms
  note right of FM
  reads IrvTcuMode, IrvFaultBits, SelectorState, GearTarget,
  GearActual, VehicleSpeed (each element <= 32 bit, atomic)
  end note
  opt every 5th activation (500 ms, SYS-HMI-002)
    FM -> DbgOut : Rte_Call RpDebugOut WriteLine(status line)
    DbgOut --> FM : E_OK / E_NOT_OK (busy: line dropped)
  end
  deactivate T100
end

== t = 1 ms .. 9 ms: OsTask_1ms preempts every lower-priority task ==
OS -> T1 : ActivateTask (every 1 ms)
activate T1
T1 -> T1 : Can main functions; Rx indication, Tx confirmation,\nbus-off indication (BSW exclusive areas, section 4.3)
deactivate T1
@enduml
